  "sourceConclusions": [
    "Only new helper, dedicated tests and evidence file added relative to ad8cc2ce. Existing shared lease/cursor helpers, runtime callsites, schema, migrations, workflows and baselines unchanged.",
    "Helper receives database client explicitly and imports PrismaClient only as a type. No route/scheduler/runtime integration is introduced.",
    "Fixed-key lease row FOR UPDATE occurs before cursor row lock. Lease acquisition/completion update that lease row and therefore serialize with commit.",
    "Existing cursor path waits for cursor row lock in its own statement; following UPDATE evaluates clock_timestamp after lock waits. Insert path evaluates lease after obtaining the lease row lock.",
    "Conditional writes require live running lease with matching owner token. Existing cursor path additionally compares version and null-safe cursor value.",
    "Absent expected state is separate from an existing null cursor with version. Insert conflict does nothing, ABA and duplicate replay cannot advance an observed version twice.",
    "Version integer upper bound fails closed; cursor and owner inputs are bounded; expected observation is copied synchronously before transaction awaits.",
    "Return states are finite COMMITTED/FENCED_OUT/VERSION_EXHAUSTED; helper does not log identifiers or raw payloads."
  ],
